        "original_id": "b10cc0f6-d3b3-5f6e-b08d-eac101ef4cf7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Red Herring, Rojo.com\n- Publications: Red Herring magazine, GameFan, GameGO!\n- People: Christopher J. Alden, Halverson, Eric C. Mylonas, Thomas Keller\n- Topics: technology media, video game magazines, RSS readers\n\nFacts:\n- Red Herring is a media company that publishes an innovation magazine, an online daily technology news service, technology newsletters, and events for technology leaders.\n- Christopher J. Alden is an American entrepreneur best known as a co-founder of Red Herring, a magazine focused on the business of technology, and Rojo.com, an early web-based RSS reader.\n- GameGO! was conceived by Eric C. Mylonas and Thomas Keller and staffed by former GameFan editors to follow the defunct GameFan Magazine and focus more deeply on the hardcore gaming market.\n- In April 2010, Halverson relaunched GameFan as a hybrid video game and film magazine.",
